      ":question/problem": "A pasture covers $160$ acres. To estimate the total number of cows grazing, a researcher randomly selects $8$ different $1$-acre plots and counts the cows in each plot. The numbers are $12$, $15$, $14$, $10$, $16$, $13$, $11$, and $15$.\n\nBased on the **mean** of the sample, which of the following ranges contains the best estimate for the number of cows in the entire pasture?"
